---
// Component: Reviews.astro
---
<!-- 10. WHY CHOOSE US (WIREFRAME BLOCK 10 - SPLIT LAYOUT) -->
  <section id="why-choose-us" class="py-20 relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        
        <!-- Checklist (Strictly from wireframe block 10) -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-950/50 border border-blue-200 dark:border-blue-800/50">
            Installer Credibility
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
            Why Choose CCTV Carindale?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            We are dedicated local security camera installers based in Brisbane's eastern suburbs. We do not subcontract your job to untested gig-economy workers.
          </p>

          <ul class="space-y-3.5 pt-2">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Show the named installer and real experience:</strong> You speak directly with the technician who designs and installs your system.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Publish verified licence and cabler details:</strong> Full Class 1 &amp; 2 Security Firm and Security Installer credentials under Queensland Police Service licensing.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Explain workmanship and equipment warranties separately:</strong> 3-Year official equipment warranty plus our written 5-year cabling workmanship guarantee.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>State who provides support after installation:</strong> When you call for help with an app or to pull footage, a local technician answers.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Show clean cabling and recorder installations:</strong> Concealed in-roof wiring, silicone weather sealing, and tidy cable management.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base">
              <span class="text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-base mt-0.5 shrink-0">✓</span>
              <span><strong>Use plain English explanations with no technical jargon:</strong> We explain the app clearly and patiently so anyone can view footage easily.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <!-- Visual Credentials Box -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5">
          <div class="glass-box p-8 rounded-3xl border-2 border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 space-y-6 text-center shadow-xl">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 rounded-3xl bg-blue-600/15 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 mx-auto flex items-center justify-center text-4xl shadow-inner">
              👨‍🔧
            </div>
            
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Local Licensed Installer</h3>
              <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 mt-1">Direct Field Experience in Carindale (4152)</p>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 sm:p-5 rounded-2xl bg-slate-100/90 dark:bg-slate-900/90 border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 space-y-3 text-left">
              
              <!-- Jurisdiction -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">
                  Jurisdiction
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-right">
                  QLD Police Service
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Licence Class -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">
                  Licence Class
                </span>
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-emerald-50 dark:bg-emerald-500/15 text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-400 font-bold text-xs border border-emerald-300 dark:border-emerald-500/30 text-right">
                  Class 1 &amp; 2 Security Firm
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Telecommunications / Cabling -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 pb-2.5 border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">
                  Cabling Licence
                </span>
                <span class="px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-500/15 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs border border-blue-300 dark:border-blue-500/30 text-right">
                  ACMA Open Registered
                </span>
              </div>

              <!-- Public Liability -->
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 shrink-0">
                  Public Liability
                </span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-mono text-right flex items-center gap-1.5">
                  <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
                  <span>$20,000,000 Insured</span>
                </span>
              </div>

            </div>

            <a href="tel:0731000000" class="block w-full py-4 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-500 text-white font-black text-sm uppercase tracking-wider shadow-lg shadow-blue-600/25 transition-all">
              Speak Directly with an Installer
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 11. REVIEWS: WHAT LOCAL CUSTOMERS SAY (WIREFRAME BLOCK 11 - 4 REVIEWS) -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 dark:bg-slate-900/60 border-y border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
        <span class="text-xs font-black text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 uppercase tracking-widest px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-950/50 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800/50">
          Verified Social Proof
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white mt-3 tracking-tight">
          What Local Customers Say
        </h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base mt-2">
          Genuine feedback from property owners across Carindale and surrounding eastern suburbs.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
        
        <!-- Review 1: Tidy Installation -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm tracking-wider">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400">Google Review</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed italic mb-6">
              "Installed 4 cameras at our home. Super clean cabling through the ceiling cavity, not a single wire exposed on the exterior walls. The app works flawlessly on our phones."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm sm:text-base">David L.</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Carindale • Home PoE System</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 2: Active Deterrence -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm tracking-wider">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400">Google Review</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed italic mb-6">
              "Replaced our old grainy cameras with 4K active deterrence cameras. The warning floodlight turns on automatically whenever someone approaches our driveway. Outstanding peace of mind."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Sarah &amp; Kelvin M.</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Carina Heights • 4K Deterrence</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 3: Business Support -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm tracking-wider">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400">Google Review</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed italic mb-6">
              "Used them for our restaurant and bottle shop. Very knowledgeable on blind spot coverage and local QLD surveillance legalities. Highly recommended for commercial jobs."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Ken W.</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Belmont • Commercial Retail Fitout</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Review 4: Patient Handover & Training -->
        <div class="glass-box p-7 rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10 flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
              <div class="flex text-amber-400 text-sm tracking-wider">★★★★★</div>
              <span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-slate-400">Google Review</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-200 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed italic mb-6">
              "Very polite, turned up on time, and spent 30 minutes teaching my elderly parents how to check the cameras on their iPad. Wonderful after-sales support."
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-white/10">
            <div class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white text-sm sm:text-base">Angela T.</div>
            <div class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">Mansfield • Family Residence</div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>
  </section>
